% YoY \u2014 may reflect legal, restructuring, or operational issues","sev":"red","cat":"trend"},{"text":"Operating margins 76% below sector median \u2014 a cost disadvantage the moat cannot hide","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Fragmented industry with below-average profit capture \u2014 no moat to protect margins","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Carries a 4863% premium to sector median EV/EBITDA","sev":"amber","cat":"valuation","magnitude":48.6335820190764},{"text":"Financial quality metrics lag Financial Services peers","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Credit cycles and regulatory capital \u2014 losses accumulate invisibly in good years and appear all at once, and the time to worry is when underwriting standards are loosest.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Interest rate regime shifts \u2014 a rapid move in rates can invert the yield curve, crush bond portfolios, and trigger deposit flight simultaneously.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Altman Z comfortably in the safe zone \u2014 a fortress balance sheet on this measure","Founder-led \u2014 owner alignment that often matters more than any incentive plan","Gross margin tops the Financial Services peer set \u2014 genuine pricing power is present here","Growing faster than most Financial Services peers \u2014 taking share inside the profit pool"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Pershing Square (PS) Stock Looks Richly Priced After Its 82% Rally","source":"simplywall.st","link":"https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/diversified-financials/nyse-ps/pershing-square/news/pershing-square-ps-stock-looks-richly-priced-after-its-82-ra","date":"2026-11-13","timestamp":1794554257.255,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.848,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Recent Investment Analysts\u2019 Ratings Updates for Pershing Square (PS)","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/11/recent-investment-analysts-ratings-updates-for-pershing